                <pb facs="0283" n="183" sameAs="frus:frus1884/pg183"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No. 665.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Certificate issued to British subjects born in France
                        of a father also born there.</hi></head>
                <p>I hereby certify that A. B. has satisfied me, first, that his nationality by
                    origin is that of a natural-born British subject by virtue of C. D. his paternal
                    grandfather having been a natural-born British subject; second, that the said A.
                    B. still preserves such nationality.</p>
                <p>Signed by one of the secretaries of state.</p>
                <p>Signature legalized by the French diplomatic or consular representatives.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
